    "text": "Maine\nIt’s Not Meant For That Kind Of Horsepower: Maine State Police Rescue Horse From Highway\nBy Cori,\n11 hours agoMaine's law enforcement officers really never know what kind of call they'll be dispatched to, and I'm betting the State Troopers who showed up for their shift Tuesday evening didn't think they'd be going on a wild horse chase down the highway in the wee hours of the morning. But that's exactly what they did.\n3",
